isuals and weird fiction environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228190/extras/9e85de7f959fa156c878f2769ee608ec.poster.avif?t=1787780266\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228190/extras/9e85de7f959fa156c878f2769ee608ec.webm?t=1787780266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228190/extras/9e85de7f959fa156c878f2769ee608ec.mp4?t=1787780266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Abyss-Borne</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line into the dark waters of a strange coastal village. Armed with a harpoon, hunt the deep ocean—but remember that something ancient is staring back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228190/extras/d75ffb491137747cd0c912992098bec7.poster.avif?t=1787780266\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228190/extras/d75ffb491137747cd0c912992098bec7.webm?t=1787780266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228190/extras/d75ffb491137747cd0c912992098bec7.mp4?t=1787780266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228190/extras/48a2f2aaf24e443b2f9497a2518f4fca.poster.avif?t=1787780266\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.a